,"user":{"login":"DjSapsan","id":12209464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjA5NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12209464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjSapsan","html_url":"https://github.com/DjSapsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjSapsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjSapsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjSapsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjSapsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjSapsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjSapsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjSapsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjSapsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjSapsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T19:25:19Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T19:25:19Z","body":"@AThousandShips sorry for direct ping.\nCan someone please advise on the progress or when it will be fixed?\nThe issue persist.\nIf the message is to big WS just disconnects and says \n`WebSocket closed with code: 1009, reason Message too big. Clean: true`","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3207777133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3209599191","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103230#issuecomment-3209599191","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103230","id":3209599191,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_TpjX","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T08:49:02Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T08:49:02Z","body":"Please don't ping ransom people without reason, I'm not part of the network team. They have it in their inbox and I don't know when they will get to it","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3209599191/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587480031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103230#issuecomment-3587480031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103230","id":3587480031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7V1Jnf","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T23:20:51Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T23:23:31Z","body":"@DjSapsan I tested, recreated, and resolved the error in Godot 4.6 Master\n\nThe Message too big error is coming from the Websocket Library Godot uses, [WSLay](https://github.com/tatsuhiro-t/wslay)\n\nWSLay throws a Message Too Big error when it receives a Message larger than it's [Max_Receive_Length](https://github.com/tatsuhiro-t/wslay/blob/0e7d106ff89ad6638090fd811a9b2e4c5dda8d40/doc/sphinx/man/wslay_event_config_set_max_recv_msg_length.rst#L20)\n\nGodot's WebSocketPeer class represents this as property [Inbound_Buffer_Size](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_websocketpeer.html#class-websocketpeer-property-inbound-buffer-size) which defaults to 65,535, but it can be set by the user to a larger value.\n\nAdjusting the MRP to set the Inbound_Buffer_Size to 10,000,000 before starting the connection resolves the issue with the MRP, and it behaves as intended. This is because the specific Websocket you are connecting to sends a message of size ~1.7 million as it's third message.\n\nI could not recreate the Deflate Issue, let me know if you can still recreate it. As for Message Too Big, it appears to me both Godot and the external library are behaving exactly as intended","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587480031/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3604047256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103230#issuecomment-3604047256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103230","id":3604047256,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W0WWY","user":{"login":"EmilyV99","id":35015090,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDE1MDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35015090?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilyV99","html_url":"https://github.com/EmilyV99","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilyV99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilyV99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilyV99/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilyV99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilyV99/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilyV99/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilyV99/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilyV99/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilyV99/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T21:29:11Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T21:29:11Z","body":"@AThousandShips so wait, websocket permessage-deflate is not planned to be supported? This is used to reduce bandwidth, and in my use case, the Archipelago Randomizer project currently issues a warning for not supporting it- and plans to hard require it in the future. Why is this not planned?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments